'''SSS Monkey King''' (猿王 En ō) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Dragon Poker Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = SSS Monkey King
|image = E 074.png
|appearance = [[Dragon Poker Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,160円 - 8,532円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has high health, moderate damage and average range. It acts more like a tank rather than an attacker.  Its damage may look intimidating at first but due to its average range it doesn't make it any more difficult than your average [[Teacher Bear]].

==Strategy==
Just like its previous form, units such as [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Lizards]] can deal with this enemy with ease.

